Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.74,0:00:11.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Mighty Little Defenders 11 – New Wild Cosmos.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.10,0:00:16.74,Title,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Painting a New Future
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.10,0:00:16.74,Title1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Episode 60
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.38,0:12:36.94,end,,0,0,0,,End
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,------------------------------------------------------
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.04,0:00:23.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Our reinforcements have arrived.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.20,0:00:29.51,Default,,0,0,0,,So many Weslies…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.95,0:00:31.99,Default,,0,0,0,,This is unbelievable.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.52,0:00:33.76,Default,,0,0,0,,To think there are so many
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.76,0:00:35.28,Default,,0,0,0,,versions of me from different worlds.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.80,0:00:50.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I’ll let a villain like you
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.56,0:00:52.76,Default,,0,0,0,,see for yourself
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.76,0:00:55.10,Default,,0,0,0,,the power of justice from across different worlds.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.78,0:01:00.25,Default,,0,0,0,,How amusing. But to me,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.25,0:01:04.17,Default,,0,0,0,,it’s nothing more than going from one ant to a whole swarm of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.33,0:01:05.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Little ants,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.49,0:01:08.30,Default,,0,0,0,,vanish, every single one of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.77,0:01:12.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Outrageous!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.81,0:01:14.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Taste my power!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.13,0:01:17.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Pleasant Iron Fist!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.29,0:01:22.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Overestimating yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.93,0:01:25.61,Default,,0,0,0,,No way…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.05,0:01:28.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I’ll catch you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.94,0:02:05.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch this!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.23,0:02:13.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that all you’ve got?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.15,0:02:25.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Sonic Sky-Splitting Slash!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.30,0:02:33.99,Default,,0,0,0,,You’ve made me very angry.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.79,0:02:40.19,Default,,0,0,0,,None of you are escaping.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.12,0:02:55.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Wherever the sword flashes, there lies the path home.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.89,0:03:18.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Matrix Beam Cannon!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.02,0:03:28.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Pixel Blade!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.50,0:03:33.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Roar of the Water Dragon!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.21,0:03:47.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Don’t forget
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.49,0:03:48.33,Default,,0,0,0,,this place
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.01,0:03:52.25,Default,,0,0,0,,is my territory.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.40,0:03:56.36,Default,,0,0,0,,What’s happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.36,0:03:59.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I can’t seem to move.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.21,0:04:00.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Me neither.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.21,0:04:01.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Us too.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.61,0:04:06.04,Default,,0,0,0,,In the face of absolute power, your struggles are all in vain.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.48,0:04:09.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Become nourishment for me, all of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.33,0:04:11.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Our energy is being drained away.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.41,0:04:14.41,Default,,0,0,0,,The disparity in power between us is like heaven and earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.92,0:04:18.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Yet, there is a solution: with wills united and merged,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.24,0:04:20.97,Default,,0,0,0,,and every bone and sinew fused as one, even mountains may be shaken!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.21,0:04:24.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.29,0:04:27.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Please channel your energy into my wings.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.44,0:04:28.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I don’t fully understand it,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.52,0:04:30.52,Default,,0,0,0,,but I think this method looks really cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.84,0:04:31.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Here goes.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.90,0:04:34.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Then accept our energy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.74,0:04:36.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Weslie.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.01,0:04:39.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you all for your trust.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.61,0:04:40.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Let’s put an end to
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.97,0:04:42.66,Default,,0,0,0,,this farce together.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.43,0:04:56.54,Default,,0,0,0,,No…it shouldn’t be like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.54,0:04:59.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I am the ruler of this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.02,0:05:04.10,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s a boomerang.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.23,0:05:07.22,Default,,0,0,0,,You think a little gadget like that can hurt—
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.46,0:05:10.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Wolffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.38,0:05:11.74,Default,,0,0,0,,At a moment as important as this,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.74,0:05:13.90,Default,,0,0,0,,how could {\i1}I{\i0}, King Wolffy, possibly be absent?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.46,0:05:16.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Let us show you
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.20,0:05:18.67,Default,,0,0,0,,the true power of Weslie and Wolffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.55,0:05:20.11,Default,,0,0,0,,No…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.27,0:05:20.95,Default,,0,0,0,,No…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.91,0:05:23.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I am the chosen protagonist!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.83,0:05:25.95,Default,,0,0,0,,It is impossible for me to fail!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.75,0:05:44.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Planie, you did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.11,0:05:49.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I finally succeeded in saving our world.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.64,0:05:54.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I…I’m back.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.36,0:05:55.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Weslie.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.44,0:06:06.24,Default,,0,0,0,,This is…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.52,0:06:09.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Big Sister, welcome home.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.64,0:06:14.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.40,0:06:15.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Xi Huahua.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.49,0:06:24.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Mommy, look.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.65,0:06:27.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Green Green Grassland has been restored too.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.05,0:06:29.73,Default,,0,0,0,,You all did a wonderful job.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.21,0:06:32.40,Default,,0,0,0,,That’s great! We did it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.36,0:06:37.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr. Slowy, all the other worlds are recovering.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.36,0:06:40.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Only theirs is still fading away.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.03,0:06:43.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Is there anything we can do?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.31,0:06:46.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I was thinking about the Xilan Tree.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.00,0:06:50.64,Default,,0,0,0,,The Xilan Tree possesses a power called Spark.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.72,0:06:54.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Perhaps every world has its own Spark.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.91,0:06:56.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Peach’s world
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.51,0:07:00.36,Default,,0,0,0,,is facing its current crisis because its Spark has gone out.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.40,0:07:02.71,Default,,0,0,0,,If we want to save them,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.03,0:07:05.07,Default,,0,0,0,,we have to help them find the Spark.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.95,0:07:06.99,Default,,0,0,0,,The Spark?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.19,0:07:22.74,Default,,0,0,0,,We’ve worked so hard for so long…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.22,0:07:25.14,Default,,0,0,0,,It was all in vain after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.70,0:07:27.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that our final destination?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.66,0:07:29.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop looking.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.90,0:07:32.74,Default,,0,0,0,,In the end, we cannot change our fate of fading.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.05,0:07:40.85,Default,,0,0,0,,That is…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.89,0:07:43.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Don’t give up.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.56,0:07:43.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Don’t give up.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.80,0:07:44.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Don’t give up.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.54,0:07:49.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you here?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.18,0:07:53.30,Default,,0,0,0,,We promised to help you, and we certainly won’t go back on our word.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.54,0:07:55.17,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s dangerous for you to be here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.85,0:07:58.53,Default,,0,0,0,,You might fade away along with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.45,0:08:04.68,Default,,0,0,0,,You can’t give up.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.32,0:08:06.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.52,0:08:08.94,Default,,0,0,0,,You need to feel the power that belongs to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.54,0:08:11.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Feel…our power.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.82,0:08:14.94,Default,,0,0,0,,You may have forgotten, but think of other worlds.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.26,0:08:17.13,Default,,0,0,0,,They, too, once faced crises.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.25,0:08:20.93,Default,,0,0,0,,But in the end, they all used their own strength to protect their respective worlds.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.09,0:08:22.29,Default,,0,0,0,,The power of courage.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.53,0:08:23.65,Default,,0,0,0,,The power of sacrifice.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.05,0:08:25.36,Default,,0,0,0,,The power of unity.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.04,0:08:28.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Because of this, their worlds were reborn.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.92,0:08:31.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Even after being destroyed, they could recover.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.05,0:08:34.09,Default,,0,0,0,,That is the power of their worlds.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.85,0:08:38.00,Default,,0,0,0,,The key to saving your world lies within yourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.80,0:08:42.20,Default,,0,0,0,,That power will surely lead everyone to hope.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.80,0:08:53.92,Default,,0,0,0,,What is the power of our world?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.30,0:09:01.34,Default,,0,0,0,,The power of our world…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.58,0:09:11.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Could it be…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.06,0:09:13.94,Default,,0,0,0,,that the power of our world is…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.73,0:09:19.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I can feel it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.62,0:09:34.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Let’s do it together.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.83,0:10:22.87,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s so beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.35,0:10:26.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this what their world truly looks like?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.03,0:10:39.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you for guiding us
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.30,0:10:43.62,Default,,0,0,0,,and helping us find our own power.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.90,0:10:46.27,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s so great to have met you all.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.35,0:10:52.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Let’s not stop creating.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.54,0:10:53.90,Default,,0,0,0,,For the sake of our world.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.35,0:11:13.10,Default,,0,0,0,,The weather is so nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.26,0:11:14.42,Default,,0,0,0,,It really is.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.11,0:11:22.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Finished the drawing.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.58,0:11:23.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me see.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.74,0:11:26.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Congratulations on the new king’s ascension.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.42,0:11:28.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Take a look at mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.73,0:11:39.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I’m done drawing.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.09,0:11:41.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I’m done too.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.33,0:11:43.56,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s so beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.09,0:11:47.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Sparky, what are you drawing?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.53,0:11:50.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Come and admire my masterpiece.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.40,0:11:54.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Come to think of it,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.28,0:11:57.65,Default,,0,0,0,,why was it only Weslies who appeared back then?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.01,0:11:58.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.53,0:12:01.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I’d like to know that too.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.72,0:12:07.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Because Weslie was the first one we called out for.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.00,0:12:10.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Will you think of me first next time?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.60,0:12:14.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Let’s hang up all the drawings.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.80,0:12:22.08,Default,,0,0,0,,We really have to say goodbye this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.08,0:12:24.52,Default,,0,0,0,,So, will we be able to meet again?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.28,0:12:26.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course we will.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.19,0:12:29.03,Default,,0,0,0,,But how will we meet without the rifts?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.00,0:12:33.64,Default,,0,0,0,,As long as we believe, we will definitely meet again.
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,------------------------------------------------------
